    "text": "By Janessa Bishop ,\n1 days ago BANGOR -- A local race car driver is in the hospital in critical condition after a crash at Speedway 95. Cam Childs was competing this weekend on Saturday at Speedway 95. According to his uncle, his car was having troubles, but before the race everything seemed to be fixed and ready to go. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 9",
